-flex tw-items-center\">Em casos de recusa o AD est&#225; informando o portal da Syscob, hoje esse portal n&#227;o est&#225; ativado, podemos retirar essa fraseologia.</h4>',3,'2025-02-03 17:24:12','2025-02-03','2025-01-31','2025-05-17 04:40:08',12,0,5,NULL,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,6,'project',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(121,'Criar roteiro de teste','<p>Precisamos criar roteiro de testes para documentar e realizarmos o teste junto com o cliente</p>',2,'2025-02-03 17:26:49','2025-02-03','2025-01-31','2025-05-17 04:40:08',12,0,5,NULL,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,6,'project',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,1,0,0,0),(123,'Criação de Dashboard - Mensagens x Hora - Synesis','<p>Criar no <span style=\"color:rgb(186,55,42);\">MetaBase</span> um <span style=\"color:rgb(186,55,42);\">DashBoard</span> que explicita o fluxo de mensagens da plataforma <span style=\"color:rgb(186,55,42);\">Synesis</span>, separado por intervalos de UMA hora.&#160;</p>\n<p><br>Exemplo:</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(10,81,241);background-color:rgb(206,212,217);\">~~ 13h as 14h&#160; &#160;-&#160; &#160;22 Mensagens enviadas</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(10,81,241);background-color:rgb(206,212,217);\">~~ 14h as 15h&#160; &#160;-&#160; &#160;17 Mensagens enviadas</span></p>\n<p>Sendo poss&#237;vel aplicar o <span style=\"background-color:rgb(206,212,217);color:rgb(10,81,241);\">filtro de datas</span>, permitindo a vis&#227;o retroativa do meses anteriores.</p>',2,'2025-02-04 13:00:27','2025-02-04','2025-02-06',NULL,8,0,5,NULL,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,239,'ticket',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(124,'Blacklist para o Synesis','<p>A equipe operacional identificou a necessidade de bloquear n&#250;meros espec&#237;ficos de clientes dentro do sistema Synesis. O objetivo &#233; impedir que a opera&#231;&#227;o consiga acionar determinados clientes via texto. Atualmente, verificamos que n&#227;o h&#225; essa funcionalidade dispon&#237;vel no sistema.</p>\n<p><strong>Requisito:</strong><br>Solicitamos a avalia&#231;&#227;o da possibilidade de implementa&#231;&#227;o de um recurso que permita o bloqueio de n&#250;meros espec&#237;ficos dentro do Synesis, garantindo que a opera&#231;&#227;o n&#227;o consiga entrar em contato com esses clientes.</p>\n<p><strong>Impacto:</strong><br>Esse bloqueio ajudar&#225; a evitar contatos indesejados com clientes que n&#227;o devem mais ser acionados, melhorando a efici&#234;ncia do processo e garantindo conformidade com as diretrizes internas.</p>',2,'2025-02-04 17:22:22','2025-02-04',NULL,'2025-03-11 09:40:46',8,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,246,'ticket',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(125,'[Metabase] Atualizar dados de fevereiro - DW Journey','<p>Vander, o banco de dados DW-JOURNEY nao contem informa&#231;&#245;es de fevereiro/2025. O processo esta rodando diariamente: </p>',1,'2025-02-04 17:24:19','2025-02-04',NULL,'2025-02-05 12:09:12',12,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(126,'WF004 - Logrotate','<p>Configurar rotacionar os logs do MySQL e PostgreSQL</p>',1,'2025-02-05 09:26:40','2025-02-05',NULL,'2025-12-01 15:55:12',14,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0.00,0,1,0,0,0),(127,'Reunião Apresentação','',1,'2025-02-05 09:57:51','2025-02-05','2025-02-05','2025-07-21 09:47:47',9,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,10,'lead',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,1,0,0,0),(128,'Integração Smark','<p>Verificar aprova&#231;&#227;o evolu&#231;&#227;o do assunto junto ao Financeiro da Unimed Po&#231;os de Caldas.</p>\n<p>Proposta enviada em novembro: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1n5gmh_Xbw0rfD9T17tfFytv6W-XcrvXm?usp=sharing</p>',2,'2025-02-05 10:21:02','2025-02-05','2025-02-28','2025-07-24 11:51:14',9,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,18,'customer',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,1,0,0,0),(129,'Adicionar com copia e cco dos emails da Unimed Guaxupe ','<p>Essa implementa&#231;&#227;o ser&#225; para a ferramenta journey.</p>\n<p>(cobranca@unimedguaxupe.coop.br)</p>',1,'2025-02-05 12:21:21','2025-02-05','2025-02-01','2025-04-05 15:46:23',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,2,'project',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(130,'[Metabase] Query para DW do metabase e Relatorio','<p>Temos que criar esse relatorio no journay na pagina do Chat.<br>Nome: Conversas x Por Hora</p>\n<p></p>\n<div>\n<div><span>SELECT</span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; c.account_id, </span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; a.name </span><span>AS</span><span> account_name, </span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; c.inbox_id, </span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; i.name </span><span>AS</span><span> inbox_name, </span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; i.channel_type, </span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; </span><span>DATE</span><span>(c.created_at) </span><span>AS</span><span> conversation_date,</span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; EXTRACT(</span><span>HOUR</span><span> </span><span>FROM</span><span> c.created_at) </span><span>AS</span><span> conversation_hour,</span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; </span><span>COUNT</span><span>(</span><span>DISTINCT</span><span> c.id) </span><span>AS</span><span> total_conversations,</span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; </span><span>COUNT</span><span>(</span><span>DISTINCT</span><span> </span><span>CASE</span><span> </span><span>WHEN</span><span> m.message_type </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>0</span><span> </span><span>THEN</span><span> c.id </span><span>END</span><span>) </span><span>AS</span><span> total_conversations_incoming,</span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; </span><span>COUNT</span><span>(</span><span>DISTINCT</span><span> </span><span>CASE</span><span> </span><span>WHEN</span><span> m.message_type </span><span>&gt;=</span><span> </span><span>1</span><span> </span><span>THEN</span><span> c.id </span><span>END</span><span>) </span><span>AS</span><span> total_conversations_outgoing</span></div>\n<div><span>FROM</span><span> conversations c</span></div>\n<div><span>INNER JOIN</span><span> accounts a </span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; </span><span>ON</span><span> a.id </span><span>=</span><span> c.account_id </span></div>\n<div><span>INNER JOIN</span><span> inboxes i </span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; </span><span>ON</span><span> i.account_id </span><span>=</span><span> c.account_id </span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; </span><span>AND</span><span> i.id </span><span>=</span><span> c.inbox_id </span></div>\n<div><span>LEFT JOIN</span><span> LATERAL (</span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; </span><span>SELECT</span><span> m.message_type</span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; </span><span>FROM</span><span> messages m</span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; </span><span>WHERE</span><span> m.conversation_id </span><span>=</span><span> c.id</span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; </span><span>ORDER BY</span><span> m.id </span><span>ASC</span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; </span><span>LIMIT</span><span> </span><span>1</span></div>\n<div><span>) m </span><span>ON</span><span> true</span></div>\n<div><span>WHERE</span><span> </span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; c.account_id </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>\'1\'</span><span> </span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; </span><span>AND</span><span> c.created_at </span><span>BETWEEN</span><span> </span><span>\'2025-01-31 12:00:00\'</span><span> </span><span>AND</span><span> </span><span>\'2025-01-31 23:59:59\'</span><span> </span></div>\n<div><span>GROUP BY</span><span> </span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; c.account_id, </span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; a.name, </span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; c.inbox_id, </span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; i.name, </span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; i.channel_type,</span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; conversation_date, </span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160; conversation_hour</span></div>\n<div><span>ORDER BY</span><span> conversation_date, conversation_hour;</span></div>\n</div>',1,'2025-02-05 16:16:20','2025-02-05','2025-02-07','2025-02-05 20:37:34',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,239,'ticket',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(131,'Conectar DW no Metabase','',1,'2025-02-05 20:32:58','2025-02-05',NULL,'2025-02-05 20:37:25',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,239,'ticket',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(132,'Atualizar manual com os relatorios do Chat.','<p>Local: https://ajuda.vya.digital/books/manual-do-usuario-journey/page/chat<br>Os nomes dos relatorios alteraram, entao teremos que coletar uma nova imagem de alterar os nomes dos topicos.&#160;<br><br>Precisa terminar a descri&#231;&#227;o dos campos do Relatorio Resumo e adicionar o Conversas x hora</p>',1,'2025-02-05 20:34:50','2025-02-05',NULL,'2025-02-06 13:02:16',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,239,'ticket',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(133,'Criar visualização Metabase com o Filtro Paschoalotto e publicar no Journey no menu metabase','<p>Criar visualiza&#231;&#227;o Metabae com o Filtro Paschoalotto e publica rno Journey no menu metabase<br><br>Gabriel, ap&#243;s voce terminar o grafico/dashboard no metabase da paschoalotto. Valide o dashboard com&#160; a Monique. Temos que entregar uma vis&#227;o profissional desses dados.</p>\n<p>Fora isso informe a Monique que j&#225; temos o novo relatorio dentro do Journey e combine como ir&#225; apresentar para o cliente.</p>',2,'2025-02-05 20:37:06','2025-02-05','2025-02-07','2025-02-25 18:03:28',5,0,5,NULL,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,239,'ticket',0,0,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(134,'[journey] Tela de configuração - parâmetros não atualiza dados na tela','',1,'2025-02-06 10:48:45','2025-02-06','2025-02-06','2025-03-11 09:19:01',10,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(135,'Após criar máquina na Vale Cloud - cadastrar no Ajuda','',1,'2025-02-06 11:06:24','2025-02-06','2025-02-10','2025-04-05 15:44:55',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,7,'project',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(136,'Realizar a instalação do Iso indicado pela Khomp','',1,'2025-02-06 11:06:55','2025-02-06',NULL,'2025-04-05 15:44:55',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,7,'project',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(137,'Contrato - Cláusula Faturamento Setup x Recorrência