feito. Em instantes voc&#234; receber&#225; o boleto por e-mail e pelo WhatsApp. Em caso de duvidas, voc&#234; pode acessar o Portal da Unimed Guaxup&#233;, pelo Aplicativo <span style=\"background-color:rgb(251,238,184);\">Unimed Guaxup&#233; Cliente </span>ou com a Central de Cobran&#231;as: WhatsApp: DDD (35) 98862-8436. Pedido feito e atenddo no mesmo dia.</p>',1,'2025-02-07 17:51:29','2025-02-06',NULL,'2025-04-05 15:46:23',12,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,2,'project',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(145,'[Grupo Zelo] Olhar o getassociate quando aparece erro de token','<p>A API da Grupo Zelo na parte de Token est&#225; muito lenta causando lentidao no processo. Em alguns casos os tokens s&#227;o invalidados ocorrendo paralisa&#231;&#227;o do processo.<br><br></p>',1,'2025-02-09 06:50:58','2025-02-09',NULL,'2025-05-17 05:19:28',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,0,0.00,0,1,0,0,0),(146,'Desenvolver o agente virtual no fluxo ágil','<p><span class=\"text-muted\">Nos testes voces podem ir evoluindo o fluxo e verificar qual melhor se adapta, entao para os seus testes marquem na planilha de resultado quel vers&#227;o do fluxo usaram.</span></p>',1,'2025-02-10 08:11:33','2025-02-10',NULL,'2025-04-05 15:45:53',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,11,'project',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(147,'Testar em telefones reais','<p>Como anteriormente a Connect Smart j&#225; estava ciente, podemos prosseguir com os testes.</p>',1,'2025-02-10 08:12:37','2025-02-10','2025-02-11','2025-04-05 15:45:53',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,11,'project',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(148,'Efetuar a transcrição dos audios','<p>Os audios que atenderem a liga&#231;&#227;o ou at&#233; mesmo as caixas postais, podem ser analisados.</p>\n<p><br><br></p>',1,'2025-02-10 08:15:22','2025-02-10',NULL,'2025-04-05 15:45:53',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,11,'project',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(149,'Planilha de resultados','<p>Pegue a transcri&#231;&#227;o e coloquem em uma planilha onde voces colocar&#227;o a data e anotar&#227;o os erros e a nota podendo ser de 1 a 10 ou 1 a 5</p>',1,'2025-02-10 08:15:55','2025-02-10',NULL,'2025-04-05 15:45:53',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,11,'project',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(150,'Processo de análise com IA','<p>Para identificarmos se s&#227;o audios de empresa ou n&#227;o, usaremos APIs de IA, entao imagino que ap&#243;s a transcri&#231;&#227;o colocaremos os textos em um classificador de textosa, que ser&#225; dinamico a principio pode ser alterado na m&#227;o. Porque o system da IA ter&#225; de verificar se &#233; uma empresa e se est&#225; falando da empresa que temos no banco de dados.<br><br>&#160;</p>',1,'2025-02-10 08:19:15','2025-02-10',NULL,'2025-04-05 15:45:53',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,11,'project',0,0,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(151,'Acesso Web e SSH','<p>Yves, falando com o pessoal da Khomp a configura&#231;&#227;o de VPN vai demorar. Temos a alternativa de liberar um acesso web e outro ssh para eles.</p>\n<p>Conseguimos isso?</p>',1,'2025-02-10 08:55:46','2025-02-10',NULL,'2025-04-05 15:44:55',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,7,'project',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(152,'Desenvolvimento do agente IA','',1,'2025-02-10 17:08:14','2025-02-10','2025-02-13','2025-07-21 09:47:57',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,13,'project',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,1,0,0,0),(153,'Testes - Agente IA Syscob','',1,'2025-02-10 17:09:08','2025-02-14','2025-02-17','2025-03-17 10:15:21',5,0,5,NULL,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,13,'project',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(154,'Testes e homologacao com o cliente','',1,'2025-02-10 17:09:53','2025-02-17','2025-03-20','2025-05-06 11:07:30',5,0,5,NULL,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,13,'project',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,1,0,0,0),(155,'Remover e-mail pessoal do sistema de Ticket','<p>solicito encarecidamente que o Sr. remove o e-mail yvesmarinho@gmail.com do sistema de tickets.</p>',4,'2025-02-10 17:48:19','2025-02-10',NULL,'2025-03-07 11:33:47',14,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(156,'[Paschoalotto] SANTANDER V