\n<p>a Natalia pode te auxiliar para informar os procedimentos iniciais.</p>',1,'2025-02-19 08:42:54','2025-02-19','2025-02-21','2025-02-19 10:19:17',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,310,'ticket',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(183,'[Unimed Guaxupe] Reunião 19/02','<p>Reuni&#227;o dia 19/02 com pontos discutidos de possiveis proximos passos do projeto e alinhamentos, link drive: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-qV-F8WQTH7uJMtG2PFohbhJ0kQ1Z_wQ</p>',1,'2025-02-19 17:02:29','2025-02-19',NULL,'2025-02-24 09:22:24',12,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(184,'[Paschoalotto] Configurar tronco de discagem Oktor para Paschoalotto ','<p>Configurar um novo tronco de discagem Oktor para Paschoalotto, temos que cadastrar na Khomp e no Discador<br><br>Dados abaixo:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<div class=\"elementToProof\">Boa tarde.</div>\n<div class=\"elementToProof\">&#160;</div>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>Segue abaixo as informa&#231;&#245;es para configura&#231;&#227;o da rota Stir Shaken, lembrando que o protocolo da Oktor no momento funciona para n&#250;meros Vivo Brasil,&#160; Claro e TIM no CN 11, para celulares com sistema Android com o VoLTE ativo e registrado na rede 4G/5G.</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>&#160;</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>Rota STIR Shaken</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>IP Oktor: 177.154.149.210 (Prim&#225;rio) e 200.196.232.250 (Secund&#225;rio)</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>Tech prefix: 2434</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>&#160;</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>Formato de envio: tech prefix +E164 (Ex: 24345511987586952)</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>Codec: G711A</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>&#160;</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>Caso o tenha firewall na rede deve liberar os seguintes IPs e portas</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>&#160;</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>IP</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>177.154.149.210 (Sinaliza&#231;&#227;o)</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>177.154.149.212 (M&#237;dia)</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>177.154.149.213 (M&#237;dia)</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>200.196.232.250 (Sinaliza&#231;&#227;o)</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>200.196.232.251 (M&#237;dia)</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>200.196.232.252 (M&#237;dia)</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>&#160;</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>Portas UDP</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>5050-65535</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>&#160;</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>Se poss&#237;vel liberar os IPs abaixo das nossas ferramentas de monitoramento, assim conseguimos acompanhar a rede IP tamb&#233;m.</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>177.154.149.222</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\"><span>200.196.233.149</span></p>\n</blockquote>',2,'2025-02-21 09:29:36','2025-02-26','2025-02-27','2025-03-13 10:01:35',5,0,5,NULL,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,630,'ticket',0,0,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(185,'Cadastros Journey e Chat','<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Unimed S&#227;o Sebasti&#227;o do Para&#237;so (SSP)</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">CNPJ 66.453.168/0001-60</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Usu&#225;rios:</p>\n<p>Fernanda Gouv&#234;a de Carvalho</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"mailto:experiencia.cliente@unimedssp.coop.br\">experiencia.cliente@unimedssp.coop.br</a></li>\n<li>(35) 99768-4022</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Naiara Cristina de Morais</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"mailto:naiaramorais@unimedssp.coop.br\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">naiaramorais@unimedssp.coop.br</a></li>\n<li>(35) 99863-2439</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">N&#250;mero de celular para Evolution no Chat: (35)99768-4022</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">R&#233;gua de disparo de mensagens</p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">E-mail: Aniversariantes e Lembrete Exame Preventivo</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Modelo HTML E-mail Parabens: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/14ILt8-MmhN-aArbmKDNQVQYQLHSo4a3w/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/14ILt8-MmhN-aArbmKDNQVQYQLHSo4a3w/view?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<p>Modelo Lembrete Exames: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QMq26cqKAoj5u36fzHbGPQ3byCXUKr1i/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QMq26cqKAoj5u36fzHbGPQ3byCXUKr1i/view?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<p>Colocar Cr&#233;dito de R$ 100,00 - Pr&#233;-Pago</p>',2,'2025-02-21 09:35:49','2025-02-21','2025-02-24','2025-03-07 09:05:48',9,0,5,NULL,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,7,'lead',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(186,'Cadastro Journey','<p>Cadastrar Cliente no Chat para Disparo de Mensagem WhatsApp usando n&#250;mero aleat&#243;rio Vya.</p>\n<p>Cr&#233;dito de R$ 150,00 - Pr&#233;-Pago</p>',1,'2025-02-21 10:36:16','2025-02-21','2025-02-21','2025-05-17 05:21:10',9,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,13,'lead',0,0,0,0,0.00,0,1,0,0,0),(187,'[chat.vya.digital] testar migração para versao mais atualizada Chat N','<p>Passos:</p>\n<p>Temos que copiar o banco atual para backup<br><br></p>\n<p>Subir a nova versao<br>Executar os migrations do chatwoot</p>\n<p>Testar aplica&#231;&#227;o</p>\n<p>Essa a&#231;&#227;o deve ser fora do horario para n&#227;o prejudicarmos os clientes.</p>',1,'2025-02-21 11:01:32','2025-02-24','2025-04-11','2025-03-28 08:45:17',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(188,'[Paschoalotto] Criar contas no synesis','<p>Caros,&#160;</p>\n<p>Como sabem, estamos com lentid&#227;o no synesis devo a quantidade de caixas de entrada na mesma conta da paschoalotto. Eles nos encaminharam uma base com as novas contas a serem criadas e tamb&#233;m como deve ficar a separa&#231;&#227;o das caixas.&#160;</p>\n<p>Precisamos fazer esse ajuste, estarei enviando o anexo. Mas se precisarem de qualquer ajuda (ou quiserem uma reuni&#227;o para entenderem a situa&#231;&#227;o) estou &#224; disposi&#231;&#227;o.</p>',2,'2025-02-25 10:24:36','2025-02-25','2025-02-28','2025-04-05 16:08:30',12,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,1,'customer',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(189,'Contrato Free Trial','<p>Elaborar contrato de free trial com cobran&#231;a recorrente caso n&#227;o seja cancelado.</p>\n<p>Verificar tempo de teste com Anselmo.</p>\n<p>Configurar Chat e Discador.</p>\n<p>Pasta do Cliente: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15a1bufnFnmTiV3XC4MCaCb1B4FG3eBUq?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15a1bufnFnmTiV3XC4MCaCb1B4FG3eBUq?usp=sharing</a></p>',2,'2025-02-25 18:47:34','2025-02-26','2025-03-05','2025-03-11 12:27:45',9,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,4,'lead',0,0,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(190,'#724 - [Unimed Guaxupé] Desenvolvimento - Clientes com 40 dias sem informação de 2 faturas','<p>Ap&#243;s conversa com o cliente Edson, identificamos que o correto &#233; agrupar os cliente por CPF + Numero da Familia. O erro ocorreu porque nosso agrupador era CPF + Nosso Numero ou seja, quando devia mais de um boleto nao era agrupado. Estamos em desenvolvimento do novo processo.</p>\n<p>Previs&#227;o dia 28/02/2025 estar&#225; em produ&#231;&#227;o.</p>\n<p>&#160;</p>',1,'2025-02-26 11:52:15','2025-02-26','2025-02-27','2025-04-05 16:08:36',5,0,5,NULL,0,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,724,'ticket',0,0,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(191,'[121] Elaborar relatório de status sobre o projeto IDSS','<p>Consolidar dados de todas as campanhas e status para enviar ao Marcus.</p>',1,'2025-02-27 15:54:15','2025-02-26','2025-03-18','2025-03-24 09:48:53',12,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,4,'customer',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(192,'Ativar Tronco Khomp para 121','<p>Precisamos migrar o tronco da 121 para Khomp, hoje para n&#227;o pagarmos o mes completo de 02 classificadores</p>',1,'2025-02-28 10:32:31','2025-02-28','2025-02-28','2025-03-11 09:46:22',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,4,'customer',0,0,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(193,'Ativar Tronco Khomp para Veles','<p>Ativar Tronco Khomp para Veles ideal ser hoje para nao pagarmos o mes do outro classificador.</p>',1,'2025-02-28 10:42:45','2025-02-28','2025-02-28','2025-03-07 11:25:46',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,10,'customer',0,0,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(194,'Ativar Tronco Khomp para Syscob','<p>Ativar Tronco Khomp para Syscob, precisa ser hoje para nao pagarmos dois classificadores</p>',1,'2025-02-28 10:49:44','2025-02-28','2025-02-28','2025-03-13 10:05:56',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,12,'customer',0,0,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(195,'Ativar Tronco Khomp para JRC e Unimed Guaxupe - Essa rota é a nossa interna do journey','<p>Ativar Tronco Khomp para JRC e Unimed Guaxupe - Essa rota &#233; a nossa interna do journey</p>',1,'2025-02-28 10:52:08','2025-02-28','2025-02-28','2025-03-11 09:47:53',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,19,'customer',0,0,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(196,'[Paschoalotto] Ajustar timezone dos DDDs 61, 62 e 64','<p>Caros, bom dia!</p>\n<p>Recebemos um pedido da Geovana da paschoalotto:</p>\n<div class=\"elementToProof\">\"Precisamos que em TODAS AS CAMPANHAS SANTANDER sejam ajustadas quanto aos DDDs 61, 62 e 64 com urg&#234;ncia.</div>\n<div class=\"elementToProof\">A regra tamb&#233;m se aplica para campanhas que possam ser implantadas e homologadas futuramente ou que estejam em homologa&#231;&#227;o.\"</div>\n<div class=\"elementToProof\"></div>\n<div class=\"elementToProof\">Podem realizar esse ajuste por gentileza?</div>',4,'2025-02-28 11:48:28','2025-02-28','2025-02-28','2025-02-28 16:29:02',12,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,1,'customer',1,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(197,'Perfil - Cliente - Tela Midias da Campanha','<p>Deixar somente visualiza&#231;&#227;o das Midias o Perfil Cliente.</p>',1,'2025-02-28 15:30:52','2025-02-28',NULL,'2025-09-08 11:01:52',5,0,5,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,17,'project',0,1,0,0,0.00,0,2,0,0,0),(198,'Perfil - Operador - Tela Campa