-neutral-500 hover:tw-text-neutral-700 active:tw-text-neutral-600\"><i class=\"fa-regular fa-pen-to-square\"></i></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tc-content\">\n<p>Bom dia, hoje 03/02/2025, Realizei a rotina de testes e observei que o CPQD n&#227;o estava apresentando funcionamento adequado.</p>\n<p>Realizei os seguintes testes:</p>\n<p>No contexto teste CPQD na nuvem 12/13, a liga&#231;&#227;o atendia, ficava muda e logo em seguida caia.</p>\n<p>Testei nos ramais pelo Zoiper, encerrava no mesmo instante.</p>\n<p>No contexto de campanha real, atendia, a mensagem do primeiro contato era falada, mas logo ap&#243;s o \"Ol&#225;, tudo bem?\" ela morria e ficava \"pipipi\" e a liga&#231;&#227;o caia em seguida.</p>\n<p></p>\n</div>',8,'2025-02-03 08:46:26',0,'2025-02-03 09:05:12',0,1,8,NULL,NULL),(206,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,1,'d215f78a265413f50d0899f0eb07f23a','[WhatsApp] Atualização do Whatsapp Web exegindo reconexão das APIs','',5,'2025-02-03 09:33:14',0,'2025-03-06 07:03:44',0,1,5,NULL,NULL),(207,0,17,16,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,0,'47862fd62340380eb5c4a833cc4e7733','[Unimed Guaxupe] - Vya.Digital - API para buscar por Titulo','<p>Edson, bom dia.</p>\n<p>Nos testes pela manha coletamos o cenario abaixo:</p>\n<p>Pesquisamos por Titulo:&#160;<span>0351451224</span></p>\n<p>Titular:&#160;ADRIANA DE MELO CARDOSO ARAUJO<br>Numero Documento:&#160;92929516615</p>\n<p><span>Request: GET&#160;<a href=\"https://empresa.unimedguaxupe.coop.br/vya/api/cobranca/titulo/0351451224\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://empresa.unimedguaxupe.coop.br/vya/api/cobranca/titulo/0351451224</a></span></p>\n<p><span>Response:&#160;</span></p>\n<div>\n<div><span>{</span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160;&#160;</span><span>\"Results\"</span><span>:</span><span>&#160;</span><span>0</span><span>,</span></div>\n<div><span>&#160; &#160;&#160;</span><span>\"Data\"</span><span>:</span><span>&#160;</span><span>[]</span></div>\n<div><span>}</span></div>\n<div>&#160;</div>\n<div><span>Teria que trazer sempre alguma resposta, porque as dividas est&#227;o relacionadas a um Titulo, correto?&#160;Por favor consegue avaliar.</span></div>\n</div>',5,'2025-02-03 10:14:58',2,'2025-02-05 16:11:55',0,1,5,NULL,NULL),(208,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,NULL,'646a32f6d1f8446bded6ae1bca377fb8','[Vya.Digital] WhatsApp Instancia - 5514982312696 - logout.instance','Olá,\r\n\r\nWhatsApp Instancia:\r\n\r\nEvento: logout.instance\r\nData: 03/02/2025 11:35\r\nOrigem: https://wea002.vya.digital\r\nInstancia: 5514982312696\r\nNúmero: 5514982312696\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\nThis email was sent automatically with n8n\r\nhttps://n8n.io',NULL,'2025-02-03 11:40:03',0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL),(209,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,NULL,'a1c93533842df35d43419207eb7d8c5c','[Vya.Digital] WhatsApp Instancia - 551131357275 - logout.instance','Olá,\r\n\r\nWhatsApp Instancia:\r\n\r\nEvento: logout.instance\r\nData: 03/02/2025 12:04\r\nOrigem: https://wea001.vya.digital\r\nInstancia: 551131357275\r\nNúmero: 551131357273\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\nThis email was sent automatically with n8n\r\nhttps://n8n.io',NULL,'2025-02-03 12:10:03',0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL),(210,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,NULL,'f9b7654c6214bbe78138dbf829fc65d0','[Vya.Digital] WhatsApp Instancia - vya - logout.instance','Olá,\r\n\r\nWhatsApp Instancia:\r\n\r\nEvento: logout.instance\r\nData: 03/02/2025 13:27\r\nOrigem: https://wea002.vya.digital\r\nInstancia: vya\r\nNúmero: 551131357273\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\nThis email was sent automatically with n8n\r\nhttps://n8n.io',NULL,'2025-02-03 13:30:11',0,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL),(211,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,NULL,'451beb1fc57b2f64fe788b347c865c4f','[Vya.Digital] WhatsApp Instancia - 5514996195110 - logout.instance','Olá,\r\n\r\nWhatsApp Instancia:\r\n\r\nEvento: logout.instance\r\nData: 03/02/2025 13:29\r\nOrigem: https://wea002.vya.digital\r\nInstancia: 5514996195110\r\nNúmero: 5514996195110\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\nThis email was sent automatically with n8n\r\nhttps://n8n.io',NULL,'2025-02-03 13:30:15',0,NULL,0,0