;&#227;o de dois logins no Synesis. Foram criados com as credenciais adequadas.&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;</p>\n<p>A solicita&#231;&#227;o partiu do Grupo Paschoalotto, realizada pelo colaborador<span>&#160;</span><strong>Victor Hugo</strong>.&#160;</p>\n<p>Foi enviado, via grupo de Atendimento, as credenciais dos logins solicitados.</p>\n</div>',8,'2025-02-07 09:53:20',0,NULL,0,1,8,NULL,NULL),(280,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,NULL,'af818d9776411edf8f49e91ec90ebae3','[Vya.Digital] WhatsApp Instancia - 5514981821128 - logout.instance','Olá,\r\n\r\nWhatsApp Instancia:\r\n\r\nEvento: logout.instance\r\nData: 07/02/2025 09:46\r\nOrigem: https://wea002.vya.digital\r\nInstancia: 5514981821128\r\nNúmero: 5514981821128\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\nThis email was sent automatically with n8n\r\nhttps://n8n.io',NULL,'2025-02-07 09:55:04',0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL),(281,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,NULL,'ece04e9b044d7f4bec40979f8e4a6404','[Vya.Digital] WhatsApp Instancia - 5514981751356 - logout.instance','Olá,\r\n\r\nWhatsApp Instancia:\r\n\r\nEvento: logout.instance\r\nData: 07/02/2025 10:48\r\nOrigem: https://wea002.vya.digital\r\nInstancia: 5514981751356\r\nNúmero: 5514981751356\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\nThis email was sent automatically with n8n\r\nhttps://n8n.io',NULL,'2025-02-07 10:50:05',0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL),(282,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,NULL,'9d4dae3a34e8ecac58ff5c4f996c4018','[Vya.Digital] WhatsApp Instancia - 5514981802995 - logout.instance','Olá,\r\n\r\nWhatsApp Instancia:\r\n\r\nEvento: logout.instance\r\nData: 07/02/2025 10:50\r\nOrigem: https://wea002.vya.digital\r\nInstancia: 5514981802995\r\nNúmero: 5514981802995\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\nThis email was sent automatically with n8n\r\nhttps://n8n.io',NULL,'2025-02-07 11:00:03',0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL),(283,0,17,16,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,1,'0805806119120da0d8dc4dcdf571c7df','[Unimed Guaxupe]','<p>Edson,</p>\n<p>Na api que utilizamos por data (<span>https://empresa.unimedguaxupe.coop.br/vya/api/cobranca/data/inicial</span>), retornou o contat