                                                                                                                  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSign in: CMS Compliance\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYour Customer ID:\r\n\r\n647-772-7825\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAssets (2)\r\nimpacted by Google Ads policy\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nView details and fix policy issues\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nView details and fix policy issues\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDisapproved \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAssets (2) \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPolicy:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDestination not working\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHTTP error:403,\r\nPlatform:\r\nAndroid\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n      \r\n      \r\n         \r\n           \r\n\r\n \r\n        \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n	\r\n\r\n          \r\n            View the complete details of all your Google Ads account’s policy issues and fix them by going to the Policy Manager. For each issue, you can do one of the following:\r\n          \r\n         \r\n      \r\n           \r\n                  •\r\n                 Edit your ad to fix the issue. Saving your ads after editing them will automatically resubmit your ads for approval. As such, you do not need to submit your ads for review again manually.\r\n                \r\n          \r\n                  •\r\n                 For ads with destination issues, first fix your ads’ destination page, then hover over the ad’s “Status” column and click the “Appeal” button to submit your ads for review.\r\n                \r\n           \r\n\r\n            We review most ads within 1 business day. Some reviews may take longer if an ad requires a more complex review.\n\nIf you have successfully fixed the policy issues, the ad’s status will change to “Eligible” after some time.\r\n\r\n          \r\n\r\n      \r\n\r\n   \r\n      \r\n\r\n          \r\n        \r\n          \r\n          \r\n          \r\n         \r\n          \r\n          \r\n            Thank you,\r\n          \r\n          \r\n            \r\n            The Google Ads Team\r\n            \r\n          \r\n\r\n      \r\n      \r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYou&#39;ve received this transactional email for informational purposes to update you about important changes to your Google Ads account.\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIn Google Ads, you can always select what types of policy-related email notifications you want to receive.\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis message was sent from a notification-only email address that doesn&#39;t accept incoming emails. If you have questions about our policies, please visit the Google Ads Policies Help Center.\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n© 2025 Google LLC\n1600 Amphitheatre Parkway,\nMountain View, CA 94043',NULL,'2025-04-08 17:15:21',0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL),(1950,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,NULL,'1bea6ce8f2d7c1fe8466fd327e7c57ed','[Vya.Digital] WhatsApp Instancia - 14976041770 - remove.instance','Olá,\r\n\r\nWhatsApp Instancia:\r\n\r\nEvento: remove.instance\r\nData: 08/04/2025 18:51\r\nOrigem: https://wea003.vya.digital\r\nInstancia: 14976041770\r\nNúmero: 5514976041770\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\nThis email was sent automatically with n8n\r\nhttps://n8n.io',NULL,'2025-04-09 08:00:06',0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL),(1951,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,NULL,'5c132d6c16231022c0902ccf955689ba','[Vya.Digital] WhatsApp Instancia - 14976041770 - logout.instance','Olá,\r\n\r\nWhatsApp Instancia:\r\n\r\nEvento: logout.instance\r\nData: 08/04/2025 18:51\r\nOrigem: https://wea003.vya.digital\r\nInstancia: 14976041770\r\nNúmero: 55149