sit the link below (If this was in error no action is necessary):\r\n		Confirm subscription\n\r\n		Please do not reply directly to this email. If you wish to remove yourself from receiving all future SNS subscription confirmation requests please send an email to sns-opt-out',NULL,'2025-09-08 08:00:31',0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL),(2221,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,2,'329de652cbb2bff1d8b0b054bd44a40f','[CPQD] – Ligações retornam mudas e encerram em seguida','<p>No dia <strong>08/09/2025</strong>, ao realizar testes no per&#237;odo da manh&#227;, foi identificado que:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Ao discar pelo <strong>ramal de teste CPQD (8082)</strong>;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Ou ao realizar o teste manual pelo discador na <strong>campanha 153-vya.voice.message</strong>;</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>O retorno da liga&#231;&#227;o &#233; <strong>mudo</strong> e em seguida ela &#233; <strong>encerrada automaticamente</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Impacto:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Impossibilidade de validar chamadas de teste.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>',8,'2025-09-08 09:06:55',0,'2025-09-08 09:27:27',0,1,8,NULL,NULL),(2222,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,1,'404d24f77837bad5cfdb0f8e11b5e85e','[Journey] Robô de geração de mídias inativo','<p><strong>Descri&#231;&#227;o:</strong><br>No dia <strong>09/09/2025</strong>, durante a execu&#231;&#227;o dos dois testes di&#225;rios na plataforma, foi observado:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span>N&#227;o</span><strong>&#160;recebimento dos testes</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Foi realizada a verifica&#231;&#227;o na campanha da <strong>Zelo</strong> para confirmar se as m&#237;dias haviam sido disparadas.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Mesmo aguardando at&#233; <strong>08:30</strong> para validar se poderia tratar-se de fila, as m&#237;dias <strong>n&#227;o foram geradas</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Todos os par&#226;metros no <strong>Journey</strong> est&#227;o ativos.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>',8,'2025-09-08 09:13:30',0,'2025-09-08 10:56:29',0,1,8,NULL,'marcos.andrade@vya.digital'),(2223,0,0,0,NULL,'account-security-noreply@accountprotection.microsoft.com','Equipe de contas da Microsoft',2,2,5,NULL,'a83d803afd18a5b9da37d9e5946cd241','As informações de segurança da conta da Microsoft foram adicionadas','Conta Microsoft\r\n      Informações de segurança foram adicionadas\r\n      As seguintes informações de segurança foram recentemente adicionadas à conta da Microsoft su**e@cmscompliance.com.br:\r\n      \r\n         \r\n          5511930626467\r\n         \r\n      \r\n      Se foi você, este email pode ser ignorado com segurança.\r\n      Se não foi você, um usuário mal-intencionado tem acesso à sua conta. Analise as atividades recentes e vamos ajudá-lo a proteger sua conta.\r\n      \r\n         Examinar atividades recentes\r\n      \r\n      Para recusar ou alterar o local em que você recebe notificações de segurança, clique aqui.      \r\n      Obrigado,\r\n      Equipe de contas da Microsoft\r\n\r\nPolítica de PrivacidadeMicrosoft Corporation, One Microsoft Way, Redmond, WA 98052',NULL,'2025-09-09 09:40:05',0,'2025-09-10 17:40:04',0,1,0,NULL,NULL),(2224,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,1,'1ca6b29c1fdb9173923e2e13b68292c2','[Journey] Relatorio Chat','<p>Na aba relat&#243;rios &gt; chat, quando clicamos em contas, n&#227;o s&#227;o apresentadas as empresas que temos. Mesmo aguardando um tempo, n&#227;o s&#227;o listadas as empresas:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://suporte.vya.digital/media/public/relatorio_journey_chat.png\" width=\"802\" height=\"394\" alt=\"\"></p>',12,'2025-09-09 15:48:50',0,'2025-09-10 16:56:22',0,1,10,NULL,NULL),(2225,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,0,'5f9f38bffb16e37745c28a1d3d0b937f','[Grupo Zelo] Coleta de pagamentos - Setembro','<p>Boa tarde. N&#227;o temos pagamentos da Zelo (Planos e Cemit&#233;rios) em setembro</p>',12,'2025-09-10 16:45:04',0,'2025-09-15 17:36:55',0,1,5,NULL,'michele.nunes@vya.digital, victor.delfino@vya.digital'),(2226,0,0,0,NULL,'welcome@supabase.com','Supabase',1,2,5,NULL,'d407d86d40aaf216ea6b2a93f80f4635','Supabase Update - September 2025','Supabase Update — September 2025Hey there 👋,\nHere’s everything that happened with Supabase in the last month:\nJoin us at Supabase Select\r\n\r\nSupabase Select is our first user conference. It will be held in San Francisco on October 3, 2025 at Y Combinator Headquarters. Apply to attend today! If you&#39;ve applied and have been accepted, register quickly! Seats are going fast!\n[Apply to attend]\nCome hack with us at Supabase Select!\r\nJoin us at Y Combinator Headquarters for an exclusive hackathon on October 4, 2025, the day after Supabase Select. You don’t have to attend Supabase Select to attend the hackathon, but you do need to apply first.\n[Apply to attend]\n3X Cheaper Egress for Cache HitsCached egress is egress that is served from our CDN via cache hits, and it is now 3 times less expensive.\n\r\n[GitHub]\nExpiring personnel access tokens\r\nAll personal access tokens can now be created with an expiration date and the usage of the token is tracked so you can remove the ones that are unused.\n[Dashboard]\nSelf-service SSO for Teams + EnterpriseOrganizations on Teams and Enterprise plans can now configure SSO themselves from the Dashboard.\n[Docs]\r\n\n Quick Product Announcements\r\nDeno 2.1 support has been rolled out to all Edge Functions regions. [GitHub]Dashboard updates, big and small. [GitHub]\r\nMade with Supabase\r\nshadcn-admin-kit - Component kit to build your Admin app with shadcn/ui [GitHub] [Website]\r\nMidday - Invoicing, Time tracking, File reconciliation, Storage, Financial Overview &amp; your own Assistant made for Freelancers [GitHub] [Website]\r\nOnlook - Cursor for designers. A next-generation visual code editor that lets designers and product managers craft web experiences with AI [GitHub] [Website]\r\nDevpick - Explore tools across frontend, backend, databases, DevOps, AI, styling, and more — browse categories, weigh pros and cons, and compare stacks to find what fits your next build. [GitHub] [Website]\r\nCommunity Highlights\r\nSupercharging Design Workflows with Supabase and Figma Make [Link]Goodbye Backend? Build Full-Powered Web Apps with Only Supabase + React [Link]\r\nBuilding a game with Claude Code and Supabase MCP [Link]Built a WhatsApp + Supabase Automation in n8n [Link]We&#39;re HiringCome join one of the fastest-growing open source projects ever 🤗\n\r\nWe are hiring across all departments. Here are the Jobs of the Month:\n\r\nSupport Engineer - AuthPostgres Networking - Multigres\r\nHead of R&amp;D EngineeringPlatform EngineerEnterprise Account Executive\r\nProduct Marketing Manager⚠️ Baking hot meme zone ⚠️ \r\n\r\n\r\n©2025 Supabase Inc.\n3500 S. DuPont Highway, Ken 19901, Dover, Delaware, USA\nThe email was sent to suporte@vya.digital. To no longer receive these emails, unsubscribe here.',NULL,'2025-09-11 08:00:04',0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL),(2227,0,0,0,NULL,'noreply@monitoring.cpanel.net','Site Quality Monitoring Alert',2,2,5,NULL,'f84397db1c727f1dfb8fe07853c01d6c','[Free] Um problema em seu projeto (cmscompliance.com.br) foi resolvido.','Site Quality Monitoring\r\n            \n\r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \r\n                            \r\n    \r\n        \r\n            Um problema em seu projeto (cmscompliance.com.br) foi resolvido.\r\n                            \r\n                    Página do projeto:\r\n                    Homepage\r\n                \r\n                    \r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n        The desktop Lighthouse score (performance) was within limits (current: 91, expected: >=75).\r\n\r\n        \r\n            \r\n                \r\n                    Detalhes\r\n                \r\n            \r\n        \r\n    \r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \r\n            \r\n        \r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n        \r\n            \r\n                \r\n                    \r\n                        \r\n                        \r\n                            Copyright© 2025 cPanel, L.L.C\r\n              