<span>Acion 10 - Grupo Zelo Gera&#231;&#227;o de Boleto Cemiterios&#160;</span><span class=\"text-primary\" title=\"\"><i class=\"fas fa-info-circle\"></i></span></p>\n<p><span>Job 12 - Mailing&#160;<span class=\"text-primary\" title=\"\"><i class=\"fas fa-info-circle\"></i></span></span></p>\n<p><span>Habilitado no p&#243;s</span></p>\n<p></p>',12,'2025-09-15 15:39:49',0,'2025-09-17 12:13:53',0,1,5,NULL,'michele.nunes@vya.digital, victor.delfino@vya.digital'),(2233,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,0,'7b04e47e08fb9cc91ad17e8d2c02bf31','[Grupo Zelo Cemitérios] Possibilidade do boleto com Pix','<p>Boa tarde. O Guilherme, cliente de cemit&#233;rios nos pergunta se temos a viabilidade de inser&#231;&#227;o do c&#243;digo pix nos boletos que emitimos?</p>',12,'2025-09-17 15:58:00',0,'2025-11-11 19:18:41',0,1,5,NULL,NULL),(2234,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,0,'df835ddbfd3a7a6981876cf1b2eee5a6','[Sol Copernico] Bot não responde as mensagens','<p>Dani, conforme falamos, o bot da sol copernico n&#227;o estava respondendo as mensagens recebidas. Falado na sala, resolvido no mesmo momento ap&#243;s a reinicializa&#231;&#227;o da&#160; comunica&#231;&#227;o entre o chatwoot e o bot</p>',12,'2025-09-17 18:18:31',0,NULL,0,1,11,NULL,NULL),(2238,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,1,'8ef4522ab0d74741e48a7d998f4a7f88','[Journey] Robôs de disparos de mídias inativo','<p><strong>Descri&#231;&#227;o:</strong><br>No dia<span> 2<strong>2</strong></span><strong>/09/2025</strong>, durante a execu&#231;&#227;o dos dois testes di&#225;rios na plataforma, foi observado:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span>N&#227;o</span><strong>&#160;recebimento dos testes</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Foi realizada a verifica&#231;&#227;o na campanha da<span>&#160;</span><strong>Zelo</strong><span>&#160;</span>para confirmar se as m&#237;dias haviam sido disparadas.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Mesmo aguardando at&#233;<span>&#160;</span><strong>08:30</strong><span>&#160;</span>para validar se poderia tratar-se de fila, as m&#237;dias<span>&#160;</span><strong>n&#227;o foram geradas</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Todos os par&#226;metros no<span>&#160;</span><strong>Journey</strong><span>&#160;</span>est&#227;o ativos.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>',8,'2025-09-22 08:37:59',0,'2025-09-22 08:56:21',0,1,10,NULL,NULL),(2241,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,3,5,2,'7faaeef601572cd61018e495cb43ea9d','[Dialer] Retornando code 34 em todas as ligações','<p><strong>No dia 24/09/2025, &#224;s 08h14, foi observado que todas as liga&#231;&#245;es realizadas at&#233; aquele hor&#225;rio pela Veles retornaram com o c&#243;digo 34.</strong></p>\n<p>Subi a rotina de testes no Journey e, ao realizar o teste de voz pelo discador, o mesmo comportamento foi identificado, retornando tamb&#233;m code 34.</p>\n<p>Importante ressaltar que os servi&#231;os testados pelos ramais de <strong>CPQD</strong> e <strong>Azure</strong> est&#227;o operando normalmente.</p>',8,'2025-09-24 09:11:15',0,'2025-09-24 09:37:33',0,1,11,NULL,NULL),(2242,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,3,'f012f26523873637a437687a186dc56c','Chat e Synchat sem acesso','<p><span>Ap&#243;s verifica&#231;&#245;es, identifiquei que Synchat &amp; Chat est&#227;o sem acesso.</span></p>\n<p>Testes realizados:</p>\n<p>Outro navegador, guia an&#244;nima = sem acesso.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>nslookup synchat.vya.digital<br>Servidor: &#160;menuvivofibra.br<br>Address: &#160;fe80::dac6:78ff:fee9:d360</p>\n<p>N&#227;o &#233; resposta autoritativa:<br>Nome: &#160; &#160;synchat.vya.digital<br>Address: &#160;86.48.16.121</p>\n<p>ping 86.48.16.121</p>\n<p>Disparando 86.48.16.121 com 32 bytes de dados:<br>Resposta de 86.48.16.121: bytes=32 tempo=191ms TTL=52<br>Resposta de 86.48.16.121: bytes=32 tempo=135ms TTL=52<br>Resposta de 86.48.16.121: bytes=32 tempo=175ms TTL=52<br>Resposta de 86.48.16.121: bytes=32 tempo=204ms TTL=52</p>\n<p>Estat&#237;sticas do Ping para 86.48.16.121:<br>&#160; &#160; Pacotes: Enviados = 4, Recebidos = 4, Perdidos = 0 (0% de<br>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;perda),<br>Aproximar um n&#250;mero redondo de vezes em milissegundos:<br>&#160; &#160; M&#237;nimo = 135ms, M&#225;ximo = 204ms, M&#233;dia = 176ms</p>\n<p>tracert 86.48.16.121</p>\n<p>Rastreando a rota para vmi1246426.contaboserver.net [86.48.16.121]<br>com no m&#225;ximo 30 saltos:</p>\n<p>&#160; 1 &#160; &#160; 9 ms &#160; &#160; 9 ms &#160; &#160; 9 ms &#160;10.10.10.1<br>&#160; 2 &#160; &#160;11 ms &#160; &#160; 9 ms &#160; &#160;11 ms &#160;177.11.48.2<br>&#160; 3 &#160; &#160;13 ms &#160; &#160;11 ms &#160; &#160;11 ms &#160;201-016-160-233.ctbctelecom.com.br [201.16.160.233]<br>&#160; 4 &#160; &#160; * &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;* &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;* &#160; &#160; Esgotado o tempo limite do pedido.<br>&#160; 5 &#160; &#160; * &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;* &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;* &#160; &#160; Esgotado o tempo limite do pedido.<br>&#160; 6 &#160; &#160; * &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;* &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;* &#160; &#160; Esgotado o tempo limite do pedido.<br>&#160; 7 &#160; &#160;12 ms &#160; &#160;11 ms &#160; &#160;11 ms &#160;195.22.219.110<br>&#160; 8 &#160; 117 ms &#160; 237 ms &#160; 201 ms &#160;89.221.41.155<br>&#160; 9 &#160; 117 ms &#160; 179 ms &#160; 201 ms &#160;ae15.edge6.mia1.sp.lumen.tech [4.68.62.57]<br>&#160;10 &#160; 161 ms &#160; 239 ms &#160; &#160; * &#160; &#160; ae2.3610.edge5.Newark1.net.lumen.tech [4.69.209.74]<br>&#160;11 &#160; 193 ms &#160; 201 ms &#160; 200 ms &#160;GIGA-HOSTIN.edge5.Newark1.Level3.net [4.59.210.54]<br>&#160;12 &#160; &#160; * &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;* &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;* &#160; &#160; Esgotado o tempo limite do pedido.<br>&#160;13 &#160; &#160; * &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;* &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;* &#160; &#160; Esgotado o tempo limite do pedido.<br>&#160;14 &#160; 258 ms &#160; 136 ms &#160; 163 ms &#160;vmi1246426.contaboserver.net [86.48.16.121]</p>\n<p>Rastreamento conclu&#237;do.</p>\n<p>curl -l https://synchat.vya.digital/<br>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;<br>&lt;html&gt;<br>&lt;head&gt;<br>&#160; &lt;title&gt;We\'re sorry, but something went wrong (500)&lt;/title&gt;<br>&#160; &lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"&gt;<br>&#160; &lt;style&gt;<br>&#160; body {<br>&#160; &#160; background-color: #EFEFEF;<br>&#160; &#160; color: #2E2F30;<br>&#160; &#160; text-align: center;<br>&#160; &#160; font-family: arial, sans-serif;<br>&#160; &#160; margin: 0;<br>&#160; }</p>\n<p>&#160; div.dialog {<br>&#160; &#160; width: 95%;<br>&#160; &#160; max-width: 33em;<br>&#160; &#160; margin: 4em auto 0;<br>&#160; }</p>\n<p>&#160; div.dialog &gt; div {<br>&#160; &#160; border: 1px solid #CCC;<br>&#160; &#160; border-right-color: #999;<br>&#160; &#160; border-left-color: #999;<br>&#160; &#160; border-bottom-color: #BBB;<br>&#160; &#160; border-top: #B00100 solid 4px;<br>&#160; &#160; border-top-left-radius: 9px;<br>&#160; &#160; border-top-right-radius: 9px;<br>&#160; &#160; background-color: white;<br>&#160; &#160; padding: 7px 12% 0;<br>&#160; &#160; box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.17);<br>&#160; }</p>\n<p>&#160; h1 {<br>&#160; &#160; font-size: 100%;<br>&#160; &#160; color: #730E15;<br>&#160; &#160; line-height: 1.5em;<br>&#160; }</p>\n<p>&#160; div.dialog &gt; p {<br>&#160; &#160; margin: 0 0 1em;<br>&#160; &#160; padding: 1em;<br>&#160; &#160; background-color: #F7F7F7;<br>&#160; &#160; border: 1px solid #CCC;<br>&#160; &#160; border-right-color: #999;<br>&#160; &#160; border-left-color: #999;<br>&#160; &#160; border-bottom-color: #999;<br>&#160; &#160; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;<br>&#160; &#160; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;<br>&#160; &#160; border-top-color: #DADADA;<br>&#160; &#160; color: #666;<br>&#160; &#160; box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.17);<br>&#160; }<br>&#160; &lt;/style&gt;<br>&lt;/head&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;body&gt;<br>&#160; &lt;!-- This file lives in public/500.html --&gt;<br>&#160; &lt;div class=\"dialog\"&gt;<br>&#160; &#160; &lt;div&gt;<br>&#160; &#160; &#160; &lt;h1&gt;We\'re sorry, but something went wrong.&lt;/h1&gt;<br>&#160; &#160; &lt;/div&gt;<br>&#160; &#160; &lt;p&gt;If you are the application owner check the logs for more information.&lt;/p&gt;<br>&#160; &lt;/div&gt;<br>&lt;/body&gt;<br>&lt;/html&gt;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>',8,'2025-09-27 08:42:16',0,'2025-09-27 09:31:19',0,1,8,NULL,NULL),(2245,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,1,'2e6b384050b54fd60cc11f0e71dee65f','[Journey] Robôs de disparos de mídias inativo','<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-12 text-right tw-mb-6 tw-space-x-2\"><a href=\"https://suporte.vya.digital/admin/tickets/ticket/2238\" class=\"tw-text-neutral-500 hover:tw-text-neutral-700 active:tw-text-neutral-600\"><i class=\"fa fa-print\"></i></a><span>&#160;</span><a href=\"https://suporte.vya.digital/admin/tickets/ticket/2238\" class=\"tw-text-neutral-500 hover:tw-text-neutral-700 active:tw-text-neutral-600\"><i class=\"fa-regular fa-pen-to-square\"></i></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tc-content\">\n<p><strong>Descri&#231;&#227;o:</strong><br>No dia<span>&#160;29</span><strong>/09/2025</strong>, durante a execu&#231;&#227;o dos dois testes di&#225;rios na plataforma, foi observado:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span>N&#227;o</span><strong>&#160;recebimento dos testes</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Foi realizada a verifica&#231;&#227;o na campanha da<span>&#160;</span><strong>Zelo</strong><span>&#160;</span>para confirmar se as m&#237;dias haviam sido disparadas.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Mesmo aguardando at&#233;<span>&#160;</span><strong>08:30</strong><span>&#160;</span>para validar se poderia tratar-se de fila, as m&#237;dias<span>&#160;</span><strong>n&#227;o foram geradas</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Todos os par&#226;metros no<span>&#160;</span><strong>Journey</strong><span>&#160;</span>est&#227;o ativos.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>',8,'2025-09-29 08:42:08',0,'2025-09-29 09:19:38',0,1,10,NULL,NULL),(2246,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,1,'e990ee69852cf184cbcb36f62c367b4d','[Zelo] Processo com status \"erro\" na fila de processos e não subiu notificação de conclusão','<p><strong>No dia 29/09/2025</strong>, observamos que o processo da <strong>Zelo</strong> permaneceu em <strong>55 minutos processados</strong>, sem evolu&#231;&#227;o no tempo.</p>\n<p>Ao verificar os logs, n&#227;o foi identificado nenhum erro espec&#237;fico que indicasse o motivo da finaliza&#231;&#227;o do processo &#8212; apenas o registro de que ele foi encerrado (segue print em anexo).</p>\n<p>Durante a an&#225;lise, foram encontrados <strong>eventuais picos</strong> com <strong>status code 503 (Service Temporarily Unavailable - Nginx)</strong>, por&#233;m, <strong>antes da finaliza&#231;&#227;o</strong>, o processo estava <strong>montando os boletos normalmente</strong>, retornando <strong>status code 200</strong> com o <strong>JSON adequado</strong>.</p>',8,'2025-09-29 11:24:59',0,'2025-10-02 08:13:52',0,1,5,NULL,'victor.delfino@vya.digital'),(2247,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,1,'4940c18095b37d3ea7486d5771374595','[Journey] Processo Zelo consta como finalizado, mas não subiu notificação','<p><strong>No dia 30/09/2025</strong>, o processo <strong>Zelo &#8211; Todos Atrasados</strong> foi executado at&#233; a <strong>p&#225;gina 315</strong>. A &#250;ltima informa&#231;&#227;o registrada no log est&#225; dispon&#237;vel no print em anexo.</p>\n<p>Na <strong>fila de processos</strong>, o status consta como <strong>finalizado e com 93m de execu&#231;&#227;o</strong>, por&#233;m <strong>n&#227;o foi gerada a notifica&#231;&#227;o</strong> que permitisse identificar se o processo foi conclu&#237;do corretamente ou se apresentou <strong>comportamento inesperado</strong> durante a execu&#231;&#227;o.</p>\n<p>As m&#237;dias para as r&#233;guas da campanha foram disparadas e enviadas, n&#227;o apresentando erro no processo ou fluxo de disparos.</p>',8,'2025-09-30 10:53:58',0,'2025-10-02 08:15:00',0,1,5,NULL,NULL),(2248,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,0,'48d6eba5e74347d114316e3c127c4472','[Journey] Usuário com visualização de outras contas','<p>Fala Marcos, bom dia. Conforme falamos, o usu&#225;rio Lucas Bernini (215), ao entrar no menu Ferramentas &gt; Comprar n&#250;mero, na listagem de clientes ele consegue visualizar clientes de empresas em que ele n&#227;o esta vinculado: Este usuario esta vinculado somente as empresas da Paschoalotto:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://suporte.vya.digital/media/michele-nunes/lucas_bernini.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"524\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>',12,'2025-10-01 09:11:20',0,'2025-10-09 18:01:36',0,1,10,12,NULL),(2249,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,2,'c8d9a8e314791c27ccb5cee76721c73b','[CPQD] Ligações retornam mudas','<div class=\"panel-body\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-9\">\n<div class=\"tc-content\">\n<p>No dia<span> <strong>02</strong></span><strong>/10/2025</strong>, ao realizar testes no per&#237;odo da manh&#227;, foi identificado que:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Ao discar pelo<span>&#160;</span><strong>ramal de teste CPQD (8082)</strong>;</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>O retorno da liga&#231;&#227;o &#233;<span>&#160;</span><strong>mudo por toda a chamada,&#160;</strong>mas ela n&#227;o encerra automaticamente.</p>\n<p>Ramal Azure (8081) funcionando.</p>\n<p><strong>Impacto:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Impossibilidade de validar chamadas de teste.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>',8,'2025-10-02 08:19:56',0,'2025-10-02 11:27:13',0,1,11,NULL,NULL),(2250,0,0,0,NULL,'noreply@notifications.getpostman.com','The Postman Team',1,2,5,NULL,'50cf0c38872ec190e30f1ca59dc17d59','New sign-in notification','Review new sign-in activityWe recently detected a new sign-in for your Postman account. If this was you, no further action is needed.\n@Accountsupport@vya.digitalDate and TimeThu, October 02, 2025, 19:23 UTCLocationIndaiatuba, SP, IndaiatubaIP Address2804:868:d047:d576:c1f3:a0e3:e06d:963eApplicationWindows, Chrome: 140Don’t recognize this sign-in?Reset your password now to protect your account. If you think your account has been compromised, p