mailer-daemon@googlemail.com','Mail Delivery Subsystem',1,2,5,NULL,'bc50e08fa134651fa57d7e30a4ec6eaa','Delivery Status Notification (Failure)','Address not found\r\n\r\n\r\nYour message wasn\'t delivered to noreply@notify.cloudflare.com because the address couldn\'t be found, or is unable to receive mail.\r\n\r\n\r\nLEARN MORE\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe response was:\n\r\n\r\nThe email account that you tried to reach does not exist. Please try double-checking the recipient\'s email address for typos or unnecessary spaces. For more information, go to https://support.google.com/mail/?p=NoSuchUser',NULL,'2025-10-06 08:10:05',0,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL),(2254,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,1,'cf1bff79ef81f19ca7e138b13287d759','[Cemitérios] Falha no GetAssociado (Page 22)','<p>No dia <strong>07/10</strong>, foi identificado que o processo da <strong>Zelo Cemit&#233;rios</strong>, programado para rodar &#224;s <strong>08:00h</strong>, constou na <strong>fila de processos</strong> como <em>finalizado</em> ap&#243;s <strong>7 minutos de execu&#231;&#227;o</strong>, por&#233;m <strong>n&#227;o houve notifica&#231;&#227;o</strong>.</p>\n<p>Ao verificar o log, foi poss&#237;vel identificar o ocorrido (segue prints em anexo).</p>',8,'2025-10-07 09:18:17',0,'2025-10-07 12:14:00',0,1,10,NULL,NULL),(2255,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,0,'50ae671b60c256c635bbe94e8d82d287','[Journey] Visualização midias enviadas - Tela monitoramento','<p>Marcos, na tela de monitoramento&gt;Campanhas tenho o painel abaixo que mostra o volume de m&#237;dias envidas apartada por cada tipo de m&#237;dia, mas o volume total n&#227;o condiz com a soma de cada uma das m&#237;dias:</p>\n<p>No exemplo, o total de m&#237;dias enviadas &#233; de 15366, mas abrindo whatsapp e sms, tenho 97254 em cada um deles. Acredito que esse total por m&#237;dia esteja contabilizando o total de m&#237;dias geradas, n&#227;o s&#243; as enviadas:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://suporte.vya.digital/media/michele-nunes/evidencia_journey_monitoramento.png\" width=\"917\" height=\"455\" alt=\"\"></p>',12,'2025-10-09 09:51:03',0,'2025-10-10 18:00:08',0,1,10,NULL,NULL),(2256,0,19,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,0,'e364d5b301e82a0fa85eb2a8211ad97c','TESTE','<p>este &#233; teste</p>',12,'2025-10-09 18:00:37',0,'2025-10-09 18:55:02',1,1,12,NULL,'michele.nunes@vya.digital, victor.delfino@vya.digital'),(2257,0,0,0,NULL,'noreply@notify.cloudflare.com','Cloudflare',1,2,5,NULL,'bd8cf4c8bf0cc17bb01d369db9d74890','Cloudflare Web Analytics','Web Analytics\n                 \n                \n                  \n                    \n                      \n                        Account name\n                        Account ID\n                      \n                      \n                        Plataformarecuperacao@gmail.com&#39;s Account\n                        0ab95ed8dd40251517865e301a452482\n                      \n                    \n                  \n                \n                 \n                \n                                \n                \n                  \n                    Weekly Summary from Oct 5 to Oct 11\n                  \n                \n                 \n                \n                  \n                    This report includes aggregate visits, page views, and\n                    median page load time for all your sites so you can monitor\n                    their performance. Learn more about Web Analytics.\n                  \n                \n                 \n                 \n                 \n                \n                  \n                    \n                      \n                        Total sites\n                        Visits\n                        Page views\n                        Page load time\n                      \n                      \n                        \n                          1\n                        \n                        \n                          \n                            0\n                          