d56c5df16','[Journey] Botão \"Visualizar campanhas de\" faz logout do Journey.','<p></p>\n<p class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">Ambiente</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf1\"><span class=\"cf0\">URL: https://app.vya.digital/Iframe</span></li>\n<li class=\"pf1\"><span class=\"cf0\">Navegador: Chrome (mas ocorre em todos)</span></li>\n<li class=\"pf1\"><span class=\"cf0\">Sistema Operacional: Windows 11</span></li>\n<li class=\"pf1\"><span class=\"cf0\">Perfil o usu&#225;rio: Administrador Sistema</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">Passos para Reproduzir</span><span class=\"cf0\">:</span><span class=\"cf0\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf1\"><span class=\"cf0\">Na p&#225;gina Administrativo -&gt; Usu&#225;rios</span><span class=\"cf0\">.</span></li>\n<li class=\"pf1\"><span class=\"cf0\">Clicar no bot&#227;o \"Visualizar campanhas de [usu&#225;rio]\".</span><span class=\"cf0\"></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"cf0\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">Resultado Atual:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf1\"><span class=\"cf0\">Acontece um redirecionamento para a tela de logout e somos deslogados da plataforma Journey, n&#227;o podendo assim alterar as campanhas do usu&#225;rio.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">Resultado Esperado:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf1\"><span class=\"cf0\">Dever&#237;amos poder visualizar a tela de campanhas atreladas ao usu&#225;rio.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">Severidade:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf1\"><span class=\"cf0\">M&#233;dia: Impossibilidade de a&#231;&#227;o em campanhas n&#227;o antes atreladas e cria&#231;&#227;o de novas campanhas&#160;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"cf0\"></span></p>\n<p></p>',19,'2025-10-13 09:54:49',0,'2025-10-15 08:50:14',0,1,10,NULL,NULL),(2259,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,3,5,1,'9dc25c6fc7a7cedb3027ea2db794a686','[Journey] Relatório analítico de instâncias sem data de desconexão','<p></p>\n<p class=\"pf0\"></p>\n<p class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">Ambiente</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf1\"><span class=\"cf0\">URL: https://app.vya.digital/</span><span class=\"cf0\"></span></li>\n<li class=\"pf1\"><span class=\"cf0\">Perfil o usu&#225;rio: Administrador Sistema</span></li>\n<li class=\"pf1\"><span class=\"cf0\">Funcionalidade: Whatsapp Inst&#226;ncias -&gt; Relat&#243;rio Anal&#237;tico</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">Resultado Atual (</span><span class=\"cf0\">Actual</span><span class=\"cf0\"> </span><span class=\"cf0\">Result</span><span class=\"cf0\">): O que aconteceu de errado.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf1\">Campo \"Data desconex&#227;o chat\" vazio para todas as inst&#226;ncias</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">Resultado Esperado (</span><span class=\"cf0\">Expected</span><span class=\"cf0\"> </span><span class=\"cf0\">Result</span><span class=\"cf0\">): O que deveria ter acontecido.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf1\">Devemos ter a data de cria&#231;&#227;o da inst&#226;ncia, conex&#227;o chat e desconex&#227;o da inst&#226;ncia dispon&#237;veis no relat&#243;rio&#160;</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">Severidade (</span><span class=\"cf0\">Severity</span><span class=\"cf0\">):</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf1\"><span class=\"cf0\">M&#233;dia: Viana Peixoto est&#225; com alta taxa de desconex&#227;o/bloqueios e precisamos monitorar quando ocorrem.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"pf0\"></p>\n<p></p>',19,'2025-10-16 10:34:33',0,'2025-10-28 10:00:08',0,1,10,NULL,NULL),(2260,0,19,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,3,'01a4948a47f5b34e6a3414e816c97533','[Synchat] Não possibilitando enviar arquivos por mensagem','<p>No dia 16/10, foi identificado na plataforma <strong>Synchat</strong> que, ao tentar enviar qualquer tipo de anexo, seja&#160;<strong>imagem (PNG) ou</strong>&#160;<strong>arquivo Excel</strong> , o sistema retorna uma mensagem de erro (print em anexo).</p>\n<p>O fluxo da plataforma segue funcionando normalmente para troca de mensagens e atendimento aos clientes, sendo o problema identificado apenas no envio de anexos.</p>',8,'2025-10-16 17:27:22',0,'2026-01-05 09:49:13',0,1,10,NULL,NULL),(2261,0,0,0,NULL,'ant.wilson@supabase.com','Ant at Supabase',1,2,5,NULL,'527c7a4b9e857343a0a6ae1dc2b6e76d','Supa Update October 2025','Recap of Supabase Select and more.  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏  ͏ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ Supabase Update — October 2025Hey there 👋,\nHere’s everything that happened with Supabase in the last month.\nComing to Lisbon WebSummit? Join us for an epic 2-day hackathon! Details below.\n\r\nExperience Supabase SelectSupabase Select was our first user conference and we welcomed hundreds of developers to Y Combinator Headquarters in San Francisco. Here is the news you may have missed:\n\r\n\r\nSupabase raised its Series E [Blog Post]Members of the Supabase Community will be able to invest in Supabase1000 Y Combinator companies are running on Supabase [Blog Post]\r\n\r\n[Watch the main stage] [Watch the build stage]\nSupabase Remote MCP ServerYou can now connect your Supabase projects with your AI coding agents using our remote HTTP-hosted MCP server.\n\r\n[Blog Post]\nLogin with Solana and Ethereum\r\n\r\nSupabase Auth now supports login with Solana and login with Ethereum.\n[Blog Post]\n\r\nPostgREST 13 is outIt includes API and Observability improvements for both new and old projects.\n\r\n[Blog Post]\nSupabase Select Hackathon\r\nWe were excited to host 150 developers at Y Combinator Headquarters for the Supabase Select Hackathon. The winner was Repatch, an AI-generated patch notes tool for your GitHub repo, turned into beautiful release newsletters.\n\r\nHack with us at WebSummit!Coming to Lisbon WebSummit? Join us for a two-day hackathon and build with the world’s foremost builders at the Supabase Lisbon AI Hackathon. Supabase is proud to be a part of Lisbon AI Week.\n\r\n[Apply Now] [Learn about Lisbon AI Week]\n \r\nQuick Product Announcements\r\nWe&#39;ve consolidated all Supabase JS client libraries into a unified monorepo at supabase/supabase-js. Nothing changes for users, but contributors should take note. [GitHub]\r\nIceberg writes are now available via Foreign Data Wrappers. [GitHub]\r\nWe made a tiny update to the Supabase UI Library to switch from stock shadcn to the Supabase starter. Gives you a lot more out of the box. [Twitter]\r\nAI reasoning is now available in the Supabase Dashboard. [Twitter]\r\nMade with SupabaseSupabricks - One-click Supabase admin panel [Website]\r\nRooRooRoo - Website Watcher that notifies users via email or SMS when content appears, disappears, or errors happen [Website] [GitHub]\r\nMarket Research On Demand - Generate a multi-page market research report on any industry, with comprehensive in-line citations, reasoning, and excerpts [Website] [GitHub]\r\nDrawcraft - Create Custom Drawing Images in Seconds [Website]\r\nCodeInn - an AI-powered coding assistant [Website] [GitHub]\r\nPodPrompt - Break down podcasts into summaries, highlights, and social-ready content [Website]\r\nCommunity HighlightsCreate real-time notifications in a matter of minutes with Next.js App Router and Supabase Realtime [Blog]\r\nThe “Egoless” Company Culture that Powers Supabase with CEO Paul Copplestone [YouTube]How I used AI inside Figma to design, prototype, and connect a real backend without writing code [Blog]\r\nI&#39;ve built a reusable Team component for Next.js 14 using Supabase [Blog] [YouTube]\r\nHow I Replaced My Entire Backend With Supabase in 3 Hours — Real Talk, Real Code [Blog]\r\nWe&#39;re HiringCome join one of the fastest-growing open source projects ever 🤗\n\r\nWe are hiring across all departments. Here are the Jobs of the Month:\n\r\nHead of R&amp;D (Engineering)Postgres Networking (Multigres)\r\nPartner Solution ArchitectEnterprise Account Executive (USA)\r\nProduct Marketing Manager⚠️ Baking hot meme zone ⚠️\r\n \r\n©2025 Supabase Inc.\r\n\n3500 S. DuPont Highway, Ken 19901, Dover, Delaware, USA\nThe email was sent to suporte@vya.digital. To no longer receive these emails, unsubscribe here.',NULL,'2025-10-17 08:00:10',0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL),(2262,0,0,0,NULL,'noreply@notify.cloudflare.com','Cloudflare',1,2,5,NULL,'882e34c11bed6f619b116c784898e7d8','Cloudflare Web Analytics','Web Analytics\n                 \n                \n                  \n                    \n                      \n                        Account name\n                        Account ID\n                      \n                      \n                        Plataformarecuperacao@gmail.com&#39;s Account\n                        0ab95ed8dd40251517865e301a452482\n                      \n                    \n                  \n                \n                 \n                \n                                \n                \n                  \n                    Weekly Summary from Oct 12 to Oct 18\n                  \n                \n                 \n                \n                  \n                    This report includes aggregate visits, page views, and\n                    median page load time for all your sites so you can monitor\n                    their performance. Learn more about 