one of the fastest-growing open source projects ever 🤗\nWe are hiring across all departments. Here are the Jobs of the Month:\n\r\nCustomer Solution Architect Team Lead (EMEA and US)Head of Databases\r\nDeveloper Relations Engineer (San Francisco)Postgres Engineer⚠️ Baking hot meme zone ⚠️\r\n \r\n©2026 Supabase Inc.\n\r\n3500 S. DuPont Highway, Ken 19901, Dover, Delaware, USA\nThe email was sent to suporte@vya.digital. To no longer receive these emails, unsubscribe here.',NULL,'2026-01-12 08:00:08',0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL),(2332,0,19,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2,5,1,'3612fbcd3cd8af865b59a7ff0210673b','Erros no agente chat moveis planejados','<p>Quando estamos no processo de atualizar informa&#231;&#245;es no CRM, percebemos que as variavies ID que identificam Contatos ou Negociacoes nao est&#227;o sendo localizadas. <br><br>Veja os logs nas transa&#231;&#245;es<br>https://workflow.vya.digital/workflow/hopMYAddY5SfznGZ/executions/1421769<br>https://workflow.vya.digital/workflow/hopMYAddY5SfznGZ/executions/1421784<br>https://workflow.vya.digital/workflow/hopMYAddY5SfznGZ/executions/1421786</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>',5,'2026-01-12 15:18:21',0,'2026-01-12 19:10:59',0,1,19,NULL,NULL),(2333,0,0,0,NULL,'noreply@notify.cloudflare.com','Cloudflare',1,2,5,NULL,'cb2cd992baf28ce53f52976ce031a197','Cloudflare Web Analytics','Web Analytics\n                 \n                \n                  \n                    \n                      \n                        Account name\n                        Account ID\n                      \n                      \n                        Plataformarecuperacao@gmail.com&#39;s Account\n                        0ab95ed8dd40251517865e301a452482\n                      \n                    \n                  \n                \n                 \n                \n                                \n                \n                  \n                    Weekly Summary from Jan 4 to Jan 10\n                  \n                \n            