asy to deploy MCP Servers on Supabase Edge Functions.\n\r\n[Blog Post]\n\r\nIndex Advisor in Table EditorIt’s now much easier to detect missing indexes in your database.\n[Twitter]\n\r\n Quick Product Announcements\r\nSupabase is now in the top-100 repos on GitHub. [Twitter]Data API upgraded to PostgREST v14. [GitHub]\r\nPython Type Generation in the CLI. [Twitter]Three new quick starts in docs for Expo React Native, TanStack Start, and Flask. [Twitter]\r\nExplain/Analyze diagrams are now available in the Supabase Dashboard. [Twitter]We&#39;re Hiring\r\n\r\nCome join one of the fastest-growing open source projects ever 🤗\nWe are hiring across all departments. Here are the Jobs of the Month:\n\r\nCustomer Solution Architect Team Lead (EMEA and US)Head of Databases\r\nDeveloper Relations Engineer (San Francisco)Postgres Engineer⚠️ Baking hot meme zone ⚠️\r\n \r\n©2026 Supabase Inc.\n\r\n3500 S. DuPont Highway, Ken 19901, Dover, Delaware, USA\nThe email was sent to suporte@vya.digital. To no longer receive these emails, unsubscribe here.','ant.wilson@supabase.com','Ticket Imported Successfully'),(2906,'2026-01-13 08:50:12','support@vya.digital','Cloudflare','Cloudflare Web Analytics','Web Analytics\n                 \n                \n                  \n                    \n                      \n                        Account name\n                        Account ID\n                      \n                      \n                        Plataformarecuperacao@gmail.com&#39;s Account\n                        0ab95ed8dd40251517865e301a452482\n                      \n                    \n                  \n                \n                 \n                \n                                \n                \n                  \n                    Weekly Summary from Jan 4 to Jan 10\n                  \n                \n                 \n                \n                  \n                    This report includes aggregate visits, page views, and\n         